        category = "PvP",
        faction = "horde",
        npcId = 12796,
        cost = "15 Marks of Honor (item 137642).",
        requirements = "Horde; Apprentice Riding; 15 Marks of Honor. No rating or racial reputation requirement.",
        tips = "Old comments quote battleground-specific marks, 50,000 Honor or 2,000 Honor. Those are previous prices. The Black War Elekk is the Alliance elekk from Karter; the Horde hawkstrider from Bork is Swift Warstrider.",
        waypoints = { { mapID = 85, x = 0.41700000000000004, y = 0.726, step = 3, label = "Raider Bork - 15 Marks of Honor" } },
        itemId = 34129,
        name = "Swift Warstrider",
        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Earn 15 Marks of Honor and buy the correct faction mount; no Arena rating is needed.\n\n1. Use an Horde character with Apprentice Riding. Search for Swift Warstrider in Collections > Mounts first; the opposite-faction equivalent may already have unlocked its counterpart.\n\n2. Collect 15 Marks of Honor (item 137642), the physical legacy-PvP tokens awarded from eligible PvP reward containers. Transfer any spare Warband-bound Marks from your other characters. Honor points shown in the currency pane are a different resource.\n\n3. Visit Raider Bork in Orgrimmar at 41.7, 72.6, near the Hall of Legends. Open the mount vendor's shop and find Swift Warstrider. No racial Exalted reputation or Gladiator rating is required.\n\n4. Buy Swift Warstrider for 15 Marks of Honor, then use the item from your bags. Check Collections > Mounts to confirm that Swift Warstrider is learned.",
