        itemId = 28481,
        name = "Brown Elekk",
        stepCount = 6,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Buy the racial or flying mount on an eligible character; no rare drop is required.\n\n1. Use an Alliance character with Apprentice Riding. A regular Draenei can buy these racial mounts without an Exodar reputation grind. Lightforged Draenei are a separate race and do not receive that exemption. If available, use a regular Draenei to make the purchase.\n\n2. Find Torallius the Pack Handler OUTSIDE The Exodar at 81.5, 52.0 on Azuremyst Isle. From inside the city, leave through the main entrance and turn left toward the elekks. If he will sell to you, skip steps 3-4.\n\n3. For a non-Draenei character refused by the vendor, go inside The Exodar and buy Exodar Tabard from Kadu beside the flight master at 54.6, 36.8 on the city map. Equip the tabard; keeping it in your bags gives no dungeon reputation.\n\n4. Enter Normal Botanica in Netherstorm at 71.5, 55.5 with Exodar Tabard equipped. Clear trash and all five bosses, leave by the exit behind Warp Splinter, reset outside and repeat until Exodar is Exalted. Check that the reputation messages name Exodar and pause at the hourly instance limit.\n\n5. Return to Torallius outside The Exodar on Azuremyst Isle. Buy Brown Elekk (28481). The base price is 1 gold before reputation discounts. Check the name: the Great colors and ordinary colors are separate mounts.\n\n6. Use the item from your bags to learn Brown Elekk. It becomes available to eligible Alliance characters through Collections > Mounts; the appearance remains faction restricted.",
