        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Reach the automatic class-unlock level on a Blood Elf Paladin.\n\n1. Create or log onto a Blood Elf Paladin. Reach level 10; this racial Paladin mount is an automatic class unlock in Retail.\n\n2. Open Collections > Mounts and search for Thalassian Charger. Clear collection filters if it is hidden, then drag its summon icon onto an action bar or select Summon in the journal.\n\n3. Summon the mount outdoors on the Blood Elf Paladin. This class-and-race unlock is separate from buying a hawkstrider or completing the Blood Knight tabard quests. The old runecloth, arcanite, gold and Stratholme mount chain is not required.",
